  title ETF Labs - About
  
block body_content
  .no-masthead &nbsp;
  .parners_page
    .row-3col
      .col
        h3 ETF Composite
        p ETF Composite is powered by the International Securities Exchange. The index tracks a portfolio of 50 exchange-traded funds (ETFs), grantor trusts, exchange-traded commodity pools, and other such similar products, that are listed on a regulated securities exchange in the US. The constituent ETFs must meet a variety of eligibility requirements that focus on, among other things, assets under management, liquidity, and share price performance. The index excludes exchange-traded notes and leveraged exchange-traded products (ETPs).
    
      .col
        h3 ETF Mapper
        p Stockmapper is a platform for presenting and classifying large collections of stocks or other financial instruments, providing an at-a-glance heat map view of the market, alongside detailed quotes, news feeds and historical graphs.
    
      .col
        h3 ETF Labs
        p ETF Labs is a Marketing and IP company that designs ETFs from beginning to end and Focuses on "Direct to Media Distribution™ "The Team: Richard J. BerthyChief Executive Officer, Foreside David Whitaker President, Foreside Jennifer E. HoopesGeneral Counsel, Foreside Sean P. Brennan President, Foreside IP Services (d.b.a. ETF Labs) Mr. Brennan serves as the business head of Foreside's intellectual property division d.b.a. ETF LABS where he is responsible for the development of new product initiatives and services. Prior to joining Foreside, Mr. Brennan owned a consulting firm where he developed intellectual property related to financial instruments (YYY – first ever actively managed ETF and patent # 7,599,873 B2 ETFs of ETFs).
  
    .row-3col
      .col
        h3 ETF50
        p The ISE ETF 50™ Index has been created to provide investors with a product allowing them to track US ETFs.  The ISE ETF 50™ Index quantitatively ranks ETFs by fees, volatility and performance and selects the top 25 equity-focused funds and the top 25 non-equity focused funds.
    
      .col
        h3 ETF25 Equity
        p The index tracks a portfolio of 25 exchange-traded funds (ETFs),that are listed on a regulated securities exchange in the US and are equity-focused.  The constituent ETFs must meet a variety of eligibility requirements that focus on, among other things, assets under management, liquidity, and share price performance.  The index excludes exchange-traded notes and leveraged exchange-traded products (ETPs).
    
      .col
        h3 ETF25 Non-Equity
        p The index tracks a portfolio of 25 exchange-traded funds (ETFs), grantor trusts, exchange-traded commodity pools, and other such similar products, that are listed on a regulated securities exchange in the US and are non-equity focused.  The constituent ETFs must meet a variety of eligibility requirements that focus on, among other things, assets under management, liquidity, and share price performance.  The index excludes exchange-traded notes and leveraged exchange-traded products (ETPs).
